        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>灯丝的电阻大,灯一定暗吗</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f0ede6;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    background: #fdfcf7;\n    width: 700px;\n    min-height: 900px;\n    padding: 30px 25px 40px 35px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0px, transparent 27px, #d8e6f0 28px);\n    font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"STKaiti\", \"Microsoft Yahei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 28px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #c0392b;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #c0392b;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .marginnote {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 335px;\n    right: 30px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .marginnote div {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .keyword {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <p class=\"title\">灯丝的电阻大,灯一定暗吗？</p>\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">同学们,我们要弄清这个问题,须知道灯的亮度,由灯的实际功率决定。实际功率大,灯就更亮;实际功率小,灯就较暗。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">同时还要知道功率的公式:P=UI=I²R=&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"red\">串联电路,电流处处相等 I=I₁=I₂,并联电路,各支路电压相等,U₁=U₂</span></p>\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">知道上面的4个知识点后,下面的题目就是迎刃而解了。</p>\n\n  <p>例题:1.甲乙两灯串联起来,哪个灯更亮</p>\n  <p>2.甲.乙两灯并联起来,那个灯更亮</p>\n  <p>已知 R甲&gt;R乙</p>\n\n  <div class=\"marginnote\">\n    <div class=\"box\">①串联 I甲=I乙</div>\n    <div class=\"box\">②R甲&gt;R乙</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"red\">针对:1. 甲、乙两灯串联,R甲&gt;R乙 <span class=\"keyword\">关键词</span></p>\n  <p class=\"red\">我们已知电阻I和电阻R的关系 未知功率P,显然用</p>\n  <p class=\"red\">公式 P=I²R来解决,在这里I(电流)相等,R甲&gt;R乙</p>\n  <p class=\"red\">所以 R甲&gt;R乙,∴甲灯亮,在串联电路中灯的电阻越大,实际功率越大,灯会更亮也。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"red indent\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">同学们,这是否和你面对电阻,功率的认识有差异,这就是物理难学的原因。所以我们要学好物理,首先把头脑中错误、片面的想法删除了,建立正确的概念和理论。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"red\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">针对:2. 甲、乙两灯并联,留给同学们了哦,若师见更师的留言哦,或下期见答案,同学们,明天见!!!</p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
